                ENNReal.ofReal (eps ^ 2 / 4)) /
              ENNReal.ofReal (eps ^ 2 - eps ^ 2 / 4))).toReal - Ytrunc omega)
        (ENNReal.ofReal p) (chaosSampleLaw M).toMeasure ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (weight3 * (4 / (3 * eps ^ 2)) * (CTail + Cret) *
